OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy overnight with heavy showers
OL,7,Ffading, although the odd isolated
OL,8,Fshower cannot be ruled out. Shower
OL,9,Frisk increased from the west through
OL,10,Fthe early hours as a band of
OL,11,Forganised, heavy and often thundery
OL,12,Frain moves eastward. Staying mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FShowers continuing through the
OL,15,Fmorning these once again often heavy
OL,16,Fand the odd rumble of thunder. Showers
OL,17,Fmove eastwards through late afternoon,
OL,18,Fleaving some sunny spells. Feeling
OL,19,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
