OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAn
OL,6,Funsettled bank holiday weekend with
OL,7,Fshowers and possibly more thunder on
OL,8,Fthe way. Staying warm to start with
OL,9,Fbut turning fresher as winds shift to
OL,10,Fa westerly by Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
